## Result in one sentence

**P5 cut P4's Gate-P metadata-build cost by about 54.8% and cut the full P4 pipeline by about 42.1%, while preserving P4's fold decisions and algebra exactly. The P5 lowering stage still beat direct/no-rewrite at 0.6544x, but the case-balanced construction+lowering result remained 1.2898x direct, so the preregistered end-to-end signal did not pass.**

